<h2>❌ Payment Verification Failed</h2>

<p>We encountered an issue while processing a payment for your invoice. Please review the details below.</p>

<div class="urgent-box">
    <p style="font-size: 18px; margin: 0; color: #ef4444;"><strong>⚠️ Payment Not Confirmed</strong></p>
    <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0;">The payment transaction could not be verified or completed successfully.</p>
</div>

<div class="highlight-box">
    <table class="info-table" style="margin: 0;">
        <tr>
            <th width="40%">Invoice Number</th>
            <td><strong>{{invoiceNumber}}</strong></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <th>Expected Amount</th>
            <td><span class="amount">{{amount}} {{currency}}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <th>Client</th>
            <td>{{clientName}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <th>Network</th>
            <td>{{networkName}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{#if transactionHash}}
        <tr>
            <th>Transaction Hash</th>
            <td>
                <div class="transaction-hash">{{transactionHash}}</div>
            </td>
        </tr>
        {{/if}}
        <tr>
            <th>Error Reason</th>
            <td><strong style="color: #ef4444;">{{errorReason}}</strong></td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</div>

<p><strong>Common Payment Issues:</strong></p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Insufficient Amount:</strong> The payment amount was less than required</li>
    <li><strong>Wrong Network:</strong> Payment sent on incorrect blockchain network</li>
    <li><strong>Wrong Token:</strong> Payment sent in incorrect cryptocurrency</li>
    <li><strong>Transaction Failed:</strong> Blockchain transaction was reverted</li>
    <li><strong>Network Congestion:</strong> Transaction failed due to network issues</li>
</ul>

<div class="text-center mt-20 mb-20">
    <a href="{{paymentUrl}}" class="cta-button">🔄 Retry Payment</a>
</div>

<p><strong>Next Steps:</strong></p>
<ol>
    <li><strong>Contact Your Client:</strong> Inform them about the payment issue</li>
    <li><strong>Verify Requirements:</strong> Ensure they understand the payment requirements</li>
    <li><strong>Provide Support:</strong> Share the payment link and instructions</li>
    <li><strong>Monitor Status:</strong> Check your dashboard for payment updates</li>
</ol>

<div class="highlight-box">
    <p><strong>💡 Help Your Client Succeed</strong></p>
    <p>Share these resources with your client to ensure successful payment:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="https://fluxion.pay/help/payments">Payment Guide</a> - Step-by-step instructions</li>
        <li><a href="https://fluxion.pay/help/wallets">Wallet Setup</a> - How to set up a crypto wallet</li>
        <li><a href="https://fluxion.pay/help/networks">Network Guide</a> - Understanding blockchain networks</li>
    </ul>
</div>

{{#if transactionHash}}
<div class="text-center mt-20">
    <a href="{{transactionUrl}}" class="secondary-button">🔍 View Transaction Details</a>
</div>
{{/if}}

<div class="text-center mt-20">
    <a href="https://fluxion.pay/dashboard" class="secondary-button">📊 View Dashboard</a>
    <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}?subject=Payment Failed - Invoice {{invoiceNumber}}" class="secondary-button">📧 Contact Support</a>
</div>

<hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin: 30px 0;">

<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280;">
    {{#if paymentId}}
    <strong>Payment ID:</strong> {{paymentId}}<br>
    {{/if}}
    <strong>Invoice ID:</strong> {{invoiceId}}<br>
    <strong>Organization:</strong> {{organizationName}}<br>
    <strong>Support:</strong> {{supportEmail}}
</p>

<p style="font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 20px;">
    <strong>Note:</strong> Payment failures are common with cryptocurrency transactions. 
    Most issues can be resolved by retrying the payment with correct parameters. 
    If the problem persists, our support team can help investigate the specific transaction.
</p>